        <mxCell id="c123" value="&lt;b&gt;分级升级&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Level1 软升级(Prompt/检索/路由,存Nacos,一键回滚,零风险,收益90%)&lt;br/&gt;Level2 策略升级(DSL改规则,影子流量验证)&lt;br/&gt;Level3 代码升级(走完整流水线,初期人工approve)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F7FA;strokeColor=#D0D7DE;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2328;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
